WEBVTT

00:00:00.820 --> 00:00:06.200
I want to see if I can do a take
where you'll throw a video over mine.

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:11.440
So like run the Seneca logo
here and then come back.

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:14.240
So like now it's just me again.

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:16.280
And then we can do a sign off.

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:18.160
Like a thank you slide.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.740
And do like a little animation.
